59af52b1-14e9-45bb-b096-75b7f4adc75b	note	BMW iX3 — vehicle candidate currently under consideration. Not available until summer 2026.\n\nElectric SUV. Mid-size premium electric crossover from BMW. ~400mi range — a key selling point.\n\nOwner history with BMW: 328, 1-series, ActiveE (loved it). Has driven the i3 — didn't like the interior, felt like "a box on a chassis." The iX3 is expected to be a proper BMW interior unlike the i3's purpose-built EV oddness.\n\nPro: Strong brand familiarity and generally positive BMW ownership history.\nCon: i3 interior was a disappointment — need to see if iX3 feels more like a real BMW inside.	"{\\"topics\\": [\\"vehicle-research\\", \\"vehicle-candidate\\"], \\"classification_confidence\\": 0.95}"	[-0.0077438354,-0.003704071,-0.0022735596,0.009239197,-0.037902832,-0.009140015,0.0051078796,0.03353882,0.0680542,0.010177612,-0.038116455,-0.06915283,-0.032806396,-0.009552002,0.032226562,0.021514893,0.0010633469,-0.034942627,-0.03366089,0.018249512,0.019546509,0.0335083,0.021209717,-0.0021133423,0.021392822,-0.029510498,-0.0541687,0.0005912781,-0.014976501,-0.022460938,0.0041046143,-0.027038574,-0.010032654,-0.030929565,-0.0031337738,-0.00010430813,0.04031372,0.05633545,0.009284973,0.015640259,-0.009918213,0.014801025,0.04714966,0.011947632,0.0078125,0.03100586,-0.009010315,-0.036834717,-0.0019950867,0.010055542,0.0098724365,0.026168823,0.008132935,0.008300781,-0.010002136,0.008918762,-0.044677734,-0.017089844,-0.016555786,0.008666992,-0.019424438,-0.02671814,0.026397705,0.04953003,0.013946533,0.012573242,0.009483337,0.05215454,-0.0020141602,-0.042388916,-0.009376526,0.0001553297,-0.02923584,0.020629883,0.04458618,-0.0011539459,0.0005745888,-0.016983032,-0.031158447,-0.035888672,0.007637024,0.026397705,-0.032684326,-0.032928467,-0.031188965,-0.0053977966,0.025787354,0.01914978,-0.042785645,-0.0362854,-0.064453125,0.007785797,-0.021087646,-0.015045166,0.025985718,-0.015296936,-9.936094e-05,0.00022876263,-0.030273438,0.060180664,-0.0308