659593a0-7b50-458e-a753-ba3215670b1b	note	Loreweave is a world building tracking and writing organizer. A desktop app for managing world building entities (characters, locations, factions, items, lore) and writing chapters, with @mention linking between entities.\n\nStack: SvelteKit (Svelte 5) frontend + Rust/Tauri 2 backend. CodeMirror 6 for the markdown editor. No database — project data stored as JSON files on disk.\n\nProject layout on disk: project.json, types.json, entities/{uuid}.json, chapters/{uuid}.json. Entity types are user-definable with custom template fields (text, number, boolean, select).\n\nKey features implemented: entity/chapter CRUD with autosave, hierarchical entity type tree, @mention autocomplete and decorations, backlinks panel, markdown preview (edit/split/preview modes), light/dark theme.\n\nNot yet implemented: relationship graph, timeline, full-text search, AI assistant, MCP server, export, snapshots, settings panel.\n\nRepo: C:\\Users\\nazuraki\\Documents\\Loreweave. Run with `npm run tauri dev`.	"{\\"topics\\": [\\"world-building\\", \\"writing\\", \\"creative-tools\\", \\"software-development\\"], \\"classification_confidence\\": 0.9}"	[-0.035816208,0.021036627,0.017975528,-0.014455939,-0.006651485,-0.028884906,0.017570978,0.0131478915,-0.04520178,0.017220367,-0.049436074,-0.009041704,0.0047399835,-0.059549835,0.03921443,0.049597893,-0.014752609,-0.03255283,6.184145e-05,0.016222475,0.041938405,-0.03236404,0.05550433,0.035168923,-0.012905162,0.008192148,-0.0042477804,0.07265727,0.0037960324,0.0016527574,0.002268854,-0.016155051,0.04789878,0.0673172,-0.021400722,-0.032310102,0.06413474,-0.010390206,0.00674588,-0.0030375002,-0.07718824,-0.021656938,0.013316454,0.010531799,-0.0065570897,0.01959373,-0.009452997,0.08544107,0.0136738075,0.020200556,-0.036112875,-0.051755495,-0.040859602,0.016222475,-0.015332465,0.01539989,-0.04846515,0.0094934525,-0.009830577,0.007450472,0.049786683,0.0025166413,0.0036611822,0.0036476972,-0.0026970035,0.0041