88a17ae3-b70c-45f7-b960-2f6437cf9436	note	# SDWorkshop\n\nA project-based Stable Diffusion interface focused on maintaining character/concept continuity across generations.\n\n## Architecture\n- **Frontend**: Svelte + Electron desktop app, connects to backend via configurable endpoint (localhost:8000 default), UI state in localStorage\n- **Backend**: Python + FastAPI, diffusers library, SQLite for model metadata, local filesystem for project data and images\n- **Real-time**: WebSocket/SSE for generation progress\n\n## File Structure\n```\n/data/projects/{project-id}/  → PNGs, thumbnail.png, metadata.json, prompts.csv\n/data/stable.db\n/models/checkpoint|lora|embedding|vae\n```\n\n## Data Model\n- **Project** (metadata.json): id, name, description, tags, base_prompt, base_negative_prompt, default_settings (width/height/steps/cfg/sampler/seed/checkpoint/vae)\n- **Generations** (prompts.csv): filename, timestamp, seed, prompts, dimensions, settings, generation time, favorited\n- **LoRAs/Embeddings** (SQLite): id, name, path, type, tags, notes, trigger_words, recommended_weight, file_hash, metadata\n\n## Core Features (v1)\n- Project management: CRUD, freeform tagging, filter by tags, browse/filter generation history\n- Model management: scan directories on startup/on-demand, extract metadata, user tags/notes\n- Generation interface: prompt construction from base+custom+triggers, LoRA/embedding panel with weight sliders, standard params, real-time progress with preview, output handling (save/favorite/delete/regenerate)\n- Prompt editor: CTRL+Up/Down weight adjustment, syntax highlighting for `(text:1.2)`, token count display\n- Settings: backend URL, auto-launch toggle, model paths, data dir, preview interval, VRAM opts\n\n## UI Layout\n- Narrow left toolbar (icons: Projects, TXT, IMG, Grid, Palette, User)\n- Left sidebar (272px): generation parameters, prompts, LoRA panel, Generate button\n- Center: image preview with real-time progress bar\n- Right sidebar (272px): project panel + recent generations grid\n\n## API Endpoints\n- Projects: GET/POST /projects, GET/PUT/DELETE /projects/{id}\n- Models: GET /models/{checkpoints|loras|embeddings|vaes}, POST /models/scan, PUT /models/{loras|embeddings}/{id}\n- Generation: POST /generate, WS /generate/progress, DELETE /generate/cancel\n- Generations: PUT/DELETE /generations/{project_id}/{generation_id}\n- Images: GET /images/{project_id}/{filename}\n- Config: GET/PUT /config\n\n## Deferred to v2\n- img2img, inpainting, ControlNet, upscaling, batch generation, queue management, LoRA training UI\n\n## Tech Stack\n- Frontend: Svelte, Electron, TypeScript (presumably)\n- Backend: Python, FastAPI, diffusers, SQLite\n- Comms: WebSocket or SSE	"{\\"tags\\": [\\"stable-diffusion\\", \\"svelte\\", \\"electron\\", \\"python\\", \\"fastapi\\", \\"diffusers\\", \\"project-reference\\"], \\"status\\": \\"active\\", \\"topics\\": [\\"software-development\\", \\"ai-tools\\", \\"desktop-app\\"], \\"classification_confidence\\": 0.95}"	[-0.007888794,0.02178955,0.039276123,-0.0034656525,-0.013877869,0.0061302185,-0.013534546,-0.0017061234,0.001077652,0.010765076,0.026184082,-0.055999756,-0.0060806274,-0.057525635,-0.0008702278,0.031158447,-0.0181427,-0.016143799,-0.018981934,0.031219482,0.06591797,-0.032165527,0.02670288,-0.006504059,0.0062179565,-0.014053345,-0.016098022,0.040802002,0.0011072159,-0.03387451,0.02734375,-0.026885986,0.00010752678,0.026870728,-0.02911377,0.030792236,0.005432129,0.027679443,-0.020187378,0.0082473755,-0.0134887695,-0.070129395,0.029251099,0.018569946,-0.023620605,0.037322998,0.0013008118,0.03503418,0.0039863586,0.020568848,-0.008102417,0.0023612976,-0.024459839,0.019165039,-0.012420654,-0.00061273575,-0.054779053,-0.01713562,-0.026687622,-0.013442993,0.09320068,-0.001917839,0.05014038,0.007007599,0.0018424988,0.0004632473,-0.020980835,0.021850586,0.0077705383,0.029815674,0.028121948,0.030975342,-0.026916504,-0.045013428,0.017700195,-0.01058197,0.021591187,0.041046143,0.0074958